=Struchtúr Leathanaigh / Page Structure=
<div lang="ga" class="béarla">Pages are divided into language sections:
# International Conventions & Symbols {{tmpl|-idir-}} {{tmpl|-inter-}} 
# Irish
# Scottish Gaelic
# Manx
# Other languages in alphabetical order of their Irish names
After that come:
# Categories
# Interwiki Links
</div>

<div lang="ga">
Bíonn na leathanaigh dhá roinnt i míreanna teangacha:
# Gnásanna & Siombailí Idirnáisiúnta {{tmpl|-idir-}} 
# Gaeilge
# Gaeilge na hAlban (Gàidhlig)
# Gaeilge Mhanann
# Teangacha eile in ord aibitre de réir a n-ainmneacha Gaelacha
Ina dhiaidh sin cuirtear isteach:
# Catagóirí
# Naisc Idirvicí
</div>

=An Ghaeilge=
<div lang="ga" class="béarla">For the most part, entries will follow this pattern but you will find details that don't relate to Irish in the ''Other langauges'' section below.
</div>

<div lang="ga">
Don chuid is mó, leanfaidh na hiontrálacha an patrún seo ach gheobhaidh tú sonraí nach mbaineann leis an nGaeilge thíos sa mhír ''Teangacha eile''.
</div>

==Struchtúr bunúsach / Basic structure==
<div lang="ga" class="béarla"><ol>
<li>''Vicipéid Link.'' (if an article exists!!) e.g. {{tmpl|vicipéid|word}}</li>
<li>'''Language.''' e.g. {{tmpl|t|ga}}</li>
<li>'''[[#Fuaimniú / Pronunciation|Pronunciation]].''' {{tmpl|-fuaim-}} / {{tmpl|-phon-}}

<ol style="list-style-type:lower-alpha">
<li>'''IPA.''' {{tmpl|IPA}} template</li>
<li>'''Audio.'''</li>
</ol>
</li>

<li> ''[[#Sanasaíocht / Etymology|Etymology]].'' {{tmpl|-sanas-}} / {{tmpl|-etym-}}</li>
<li> '''[[#Roinn cainte / Part of speech|Part of speech]].''' <br />
Order: 
<ol style="list-style-type:lower-alpha">
<li> '''[[#Focal & Infhilleadh / Word & Inflection|Word & Inflection]].'''</li>
<li> '''[[#Sainmhiniú / Definition|Definition]].'''  Numbered list of definitions (#)
<ol style="list-style-type:lower-roman">
<li> ''[[#Comhchiallaigh / Synonyms|Synonyms]].'' For a particular meaning {{tmpl|synn}}</li>
<li> ''[[#Frithchiallaigh / Antonyms|Antonyms]].'' For a particular meaning {{tmpl|ant}}</li>
</ol></li>
<li> ''[[#Leaganacha malartacha / Variant forms|Variant forms]].''  {{tmpl|mal}} / {{tmpl|var}}<br />Dialect & older spellings, alternate genders, etc.</li>
<li> ''[[#Comhchiallaigh / Synonyms|Synonyms]].'' All meanings  {{tmpl|synn||eang=:}}</li>
<li> ''[[#Frithchiallaigh / Antonyms|Antonyms]].'' All meanings  {{tmpl|ant||eang=:}}</li>
<li> ''[[#Féach / See also|See also]].''  Unordered list of links (*)</li>
<li> '''[[#Aistriúcháin / Translations|Translations]].'''  {{tmpl|-aistr-}} / {{tmpl|-trans-}}</li>
</ol></li>
<li> '''[[#Tagairtí / References|References]].'''  {{tmpl|-tag-}} / {{tmpl|-ref-}}</li>
</ol>

All entries should have the sections in '''bold'''.


Inflected forms (e.g. genitive singular of a noun) will have a shorter entry. See [[#Foirmeacha infhillte / Inflected forms|Inflected forms]].

Languages other than Irish will have a shorter entry. See [[#Teangacha eile / Other languages|Other languages]].
</div>

<div lang="ga">
<ol>
<li>''Nasc Vicipéid.'' (má tá alt ann!!) m.sh. {{tmpl|vicipéid|focal}}</li>
<li>'''Teanga.''' m.sh. {{tmpl|t|ga}}</li>
<li>'''[[#Fuaimniú / Pronunciation|Fuaimniú]].''' {{tmpl|-fuaim-}}

<ol style="list-style-type:lower-alpha">
<li>'''IPA.''' Teimpléad {{tmpl|IPA}}</li>
<li>'''Comhad Fuaime.'''</li>
</ol>
</li>

<li> ''[[#Sanasaíocht / Etymology|Sanasaíocht]].'' {{tmpl|-sanas-}}</li>
<li> '''[[#Roinn cainte / Part of speech|Roinn cainte]].''' <br />
Ord: 
<ol style="list-style-type:lower-alpha">
<li> '''[[#Focal & Infhilleadh / Word & Inflection|Focal & Infhilleadh]].'''</li>
<li> '''[[#Sainmhiniú / Definition|Sainmhiniú]].'''  Liosta uimhrithe (#)
<ol style="list-style-type:lower-roman">
<li> ''[[#Comhchiallaigh / Synonyms|Comhchiallaigh]].'' Sainmhíniú ar leith {{tmpl|comh}}</li>
<li> ''[[#Frithchiallaigh / Antonyms|Frithchiallaigh]].'' Sainmhíniú ar leith {{tmpl|frith}}</li>
</ol></li>
<li> ''[[#Leaganacha malartacha / Variant forms|Leaganacha malartacha]].''  {{tmpl|mal}}<br /> Litrithe canúnacha nó sean-litrithe, inscneacha malartacha, srl.</li>
<li> ''[[#Comhchiallaigh / Synonyms|Comhchiallaigh]].''  Gach sainmhíniú   {{tmpl|comh||eang=:}}</li>
<li> ''[[#Frithchiallaigh / Antonyms|Frithchiallaigh]].''  Gach sainmhíniú   {{tmpl|frith||eang=:}}</li>
<li> ''[[#Féach / See also|Féach]].''  Naisc i liosta gan ord (*)</li>
<li> '''[[#Aistriúcháin / Translations|Aistriúcháin]].'''  {{tmpl|-aistr-}}</li>
</ol></li>
<li> '''[[#Tagairtí / References|Tagairtí]].'''  {{tmpl|-tag-}}</li>
</ol>

Ba cheart go mbeadh na míreanna i '''gcló trom''' i ngach iontráil.


Beidh iontráil níos giorra ann d’fhoirmeacha infhillte (m.sh. ginideach uatha ainmfhocail).  Féach [[#Foirmeacha infhillte / Inflected forms|Foirmeacha infhillte]].

Beidh iontráil níos giorra ann do theangacha eile.  Féach [[#Teangacha eile / Other languages|Teangacha eile]].
</div>

