==Sanasaíocht / Etymology==
{{teimp-ct|-sanas-|-etym-}}

<div lang="en" class="béarla">
* Write name of languages as '''bold''' links, e.g. <code><nowiki>'''[[Ind-Eorpais]]'''</nowiki></code>
* Write roots or related words in italics, e.g. <code><nowiki>''*wes-''</nowiki></code>
* Write meanings of words in quotation marks, e.g. <code><nowiki>"fan, cónaigh"</nowiki></code>
</div>

<div lang="ga">
*Scríobh ainmneacha teangacha mar naisc agus i gcló '''trom''', m.sh. <code><nowiki>'''[[Ind-Eorpais]]'''</nowiki></code>
*Scríobh fréamha nó focail ghaolmhara i gcló iodáileach, m.sh. <code><nowiki>''*wes-''</nowiki></code>
*Scríobh bríonna na bhfocal i gcomharthaí athfhriotail, m.sh. <code><nowiki>"fan, cónaigh"</nowiki></code>
</div>

<pre>
{{-sanas-}}
'''[[Nua-Ghaeilge Chlasaiceach]]''' ''a-bhus''; ón '''[[Sean-Ghaeilge]]''' ''i foss, i fos, i fus'' 
