==Aistriúcháin / Translations==
{{teimp-ct|-aistr-|-trans-}}

<div lang="ga" class="béarla">Use the templates {{tmpl|(}} and {{tmpl|)}} to put a box around the translations.  If you have a long list of translations it can be divided using the {{tmpl|-}} template. Insert the particular meaning of the word as a parameter of the {{tmpl|(}} template.

<p>If there is only one translation for the word in a particular language, you only need use the {{tmpl|trans}} template (see below), but if there are more translations (in the same language) you will need to use the {{tmpl|trans2}} template as well.</p></div>

Bain feidhm as na temipléid {{tmpl|(}} agus {{tmpl|)}} chun bosca a chur timpeall na n-aistriúchán. Má tá liosta fada aistriúchán ann, is féidir é a roinnt leis an teimpléad {{tmpl|-}}.  Cuir an bhrí áirithe den fhocal isteach mar pharaiméadar sa teimpléad {{tmpl|(}}.

Má tá aistriúchán amháin ann don fhocal i dteaga áirithe, níl ort ach an teimpléad {{tmpl|aistr}} a úsáid (féach thíos), ach má tá níos mó aistriúchán ann (sa teanga chéanna) beidh gá agat leis an teimpléad {{tmpl|aistr2}} freisin.<br clear="all" />

