==Úsáid / Usage==
Cuir isteach mar atá ( <span style="font-family: monospace"><nowiki>{{fir}}</nowiki></span> ) nó le paraiméadar amháin - uimhir an díochlaonta, m.sh. tugann <span style="font-family: monospace"><nowiki>{{fir|1}}</nowiki></span> an toradh {{fir|1}}

Enter as it is  ( <span style="font-family: monospace"><nowiki>{{fir}}</nowiki></span> ) or with a single parameter - the declension number, e.g. <span style="font-family: monospace"><nowiki>{{fir|1}}</nowiki></span> gives the result {{fir|1}}

