{{-prep-|ga}} '''Cineálacha''': (asam, asat,as, aisti, asainn,asaibh,astu)
1. ó áit nó ionad. #: msh. ''Bhain sé peann as a phóca''. 2. ó ábhar nó meán nó staid nó foinse #: msh. ''Tá sé déanta as adhmad''. 3. ó raon #: msh. ''as amharc, as éisteacht'' 4. i ndíth #: msh. ''as obair, as seilbh'' 5. de bharr #: msh. ''labhairt as fearg'' 6. dealú #: msh. ''a trí as a cúig'' {{-aistr-}} {{(||C}} {{aistr|cy|}} {{aistr|br|}} {{aistr|kw|}} {{-|C}} {{aistr|gd|}} {{aistr|gv|}} {{--}} {{aistr|nds|ahn}}, {{aistr2|nds|aon}} {{aistr|en|without}}, {{aistr2|en|sans}} {{aistr|ca|sense}} {{aistr|fr|sans}} {{aistr|de|ohne}} {{aistr|it|senza}} {{-}} {{aistr|is|}} {{aistr|nl|zonder}} {{aistr|la|sine}} {{aistr|pt|sem}} {{aistr|es|sin}} {{aistr|ru|без}} {{)}}
